{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"行ってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギャバンさん  かっこよかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/25/image_7.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしい戦隊だけでなく、\n懐かしい敵も色々出てきて、\n随時興奮でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！なになにだっ！って思うと、\n周りの子どもたちも\nあ！なになにだ！って言ってて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"君たち中々わかってるじゃないか。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと、君たちは立派な\n大人になるだろう。( *´ω`* )うむうむ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにも角にも命懸けで誰かを\n守る姿って素敵です。\n闘う姿って美しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の損得とかどうでもよくて\n誰かのためにって、闘うヒーローの\n姿をみて、毎回感動します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなふうに死ぬ気で頑張れる人、中々居ないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、かっこいいと\n私は憧れます(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな人になりたい   です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒーローみたいな人に…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくぅ  勇気 ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/25/photo_2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"}